Hello, we are seeking an experienced MERN Full-stack Developer to join our team and contribute to the development of innovative web applications.
Responsibilities:
- Design, develop, and maintain both frontend and backend components of web applications;
- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define project requirements;
- Ensure the performance, security, and scalability of web applications;
- Debug and resolve software defects and issues;
- Stay updated on the latest trends and technologies in MERN stack development;
Requirements:
- Proven experience as a MERN Full-stack Developer with a strong portfolio;
- Proficiency in MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js;
- Experience with frontend technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript/TypeScript);
- Knowledge of state management in React (Redux, MobX, etc.);
- Previous work on projects involving web application deployment;
- Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail;
- Excellent communication and collaboration abilities;
In your cover letter include details of your relevant experience, a link to your portfolio or GitHub, and your availability.
Thanks.
Joseph

